        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW
Inventory for 1 MJ natural gas, burned in a gas boiler condensing modulating with a capacity of 50 kW for a multi- family house with 2100 operating hours;
UUID: 31af99cc-86c4-3a51-b148-881dd8f67d08
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_31af99cc-86c4-3a51-b148-881dd8f67d08.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
